"""
Satoshi Complex: Sovereign IoT Edge Security & Residential Health Sensor Hub
============================================================================
Production-leaning, local-first, OUTAGE-RESILIENT edge hub.

Hardened against the outage patterns in the news (bad content/config updates
bricking a fleet; upstream cloud / CDN / DNS outages; cascading dependency
failures; thundering-herd on recovery). The core idea: the life-safety path
must NEVER depend on anything upstream staying up, and NO update is allowed to
take the node down without proving itself first.

What it guarantees
------------------
- Sub-second parallel DSP triage with reverse-engineering / fault-injection
  detection (fixed: short sharp bursts => probe, sustained excursion => distress).
- Strict residential data sovereignty (local-hold by default; export only on
  owner signature, or a verified life-safety emergency).
- Real authenticated encryption of the local vault (CTR keystream + encrypt-
  then-MAC, standard-library only) -- not the plaintext-with-a-tag of before.
- Bitcoin/Lightning-style micropayments with a verified 0-sat life-safety
  bypass, using a prepaid per-peer balance so billing can never block safety.
- OUTAGE DEFENSE: circuit breaker on every upstream call, local-first degraded
  mode with a durable export queue, mesh peer health + quorum failover, and an
  UpdateGuard that validates + auto-rolls-back any config/model update before
  it can brick the node.

Standard library + numpy only. Run:  python3 satoshi_complex.py
"""
